title: "Systems Molecular Biology: computer practicals (University of Córdoba)"
abstract: "Computer practicals of the course Systems Molecular Biology (degree in Biochemistry, University of Córdoba): genome assembly, RNA-seq, label-free proteomics, functional enrichment and multi-omics integration, with a ready-made GitHub Codespaces environment and automatic tests."
